{
  "_comment": "改动路径 → 功能面 → 必须通过的测试/必须被断言的接口。规则自上而下匹配，首条命中即生效。",
  "_maintain": "新增功能时：加一条规则 + 在 tests 里指名测试类 + 在 endpoints/commands 里列出接口。change_gate.py 会强制它们真实存在且通过。",
  "_removed": "Web 面板与观察者回放已整体下线（2026-09-19）：原 web-panel / replay / frontend 三条规则、全部 /api/* endpoints 与 /ac replay 命令一并移除；HTTP 层已不存在，端到端断言只剩 startup + console。",
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "ai-core",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/ai/**"
      ],
      "feature": "AI 实验室（特征 / 基线 / 孤立森林 / 监督模型 / 集群 / 自适应阈值）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.ai.AiMathTest",
        "com.anticheat.ai.FeatureDictionaryTest",
        "com.anticheat.ai.baseline.OnlineKMeansTest",
        "com.anticheat.ai.forest.IsolationForestTest",
        "com.anticheat.ai.supervised.LogisticModelTest",
        "com.anticheat.ai.cluster.ClusterDetectorTest"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "captcha",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/captcha/**"
      ],
      "feature": "验证码（出题 / 输入分段 / DTW 判定）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.captcha.dtw.DtwMatcherTest"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "detection",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/detection/**"
      ],
      "feature": "检测模块（移动 / 战斗 / 背包 / 世界 / 玩家）+ 融合决策",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.detection.fusion.DecisionActionCenterTest"
      ],
      "notes": "跨版本陷阱由 tools/audit_dual_version.py 第 1/2/3/5 项兜底；真机加载由 E2E startup 断言兜底",
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "listeners",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/listeners/**"
      ],
      "feature": "事件监听层（含配置开关联动）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.ConfigContractTest"
      ],
      "notes": "新增 @EventHandler 事件类型必须过审计第 5 项（1.8 不存在的事件会导致整类静默失效）",
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "gui",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/gui/**"
      ],
      "feature": "游戏内菜单（槽位规范 / 跨版本材质 / InventoryHolder）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.ConfigContractTest"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "utils",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/utils/**"
      ],
      "feature": "工具层（版本适配 / 序列化 / 命令注册）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.ConfigContractTest"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "commands",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/commands/**"
      ],
      "feature": "指令体系",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.PluginYmlContractTest"
      ],
      "commands": [
        "/ac help",
        "/ac stats",
        "/ac reports",
        "/ac reload"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "managers",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/managers/**"
      ],
      "feature": "管理器层（举报 / 画像 / 封禁 / 白名单 / 审计 / 通知）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.ConfigContractTest"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "config-yml",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/resources/config.yml"
      ],
      "feature": "配置项（键名 / 结构 / 材质枚举）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.ConfigContractTest"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "plugin-yml",
      "paths": [
        "plugin.yml"
      ],
      "feature": "插件描述符（命令 / 权限注册）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.PluginYmlContractTest"
      ],
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "core-kernel",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/core/**",
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/AdvancedAntiCheat.java"
      ],
      "feature": "核心层（Grim 式架构：平台抽象 / 事件总线 / 玩家状态容器 / Check 框架 / PacketEvents 包层）+ 插件主类接线",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.core.check.ViolationDataTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.check.impl.reach.EntityBoxesTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.check.impl.timer.TimerBalanceTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.CoreMathTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.DoubleRingTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.PointHistoryTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.RateTrackerTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.ChunkGridTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.RayBoxTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.PointHistoryAgeBoundTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.check.impl.reach.ReachToleranceTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.check.impl.reach.ReachSamplerTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.check.impl.reach.ReachCalibrationTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.check.impl.aim.HitRateWindowTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.math.ViewAngleTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.update.UpdateSnapshotTest",
        "com.anticheat.contract.ConfigContractTest",
        "com.anticheat.contract.CoreCheckContractTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.util.LadderPolicyTest"
      ],
      "notes": "Kotlin 源码有三处工具扫描盲区，改动核心层时必须手工兜底：① ConfigContractTest.everyConfigPathReadByCodeExists 只扫 .java，core.* 的读取在 CoreConfigManager.kt —— 改配置键必须逐字核对 src/main/resources/config.yml 的 core: 段（CoreCheckContractTest 已把「检测 ↔ core.checks 配置项」双向一致性补上，但 decay/setback/专属参数的默认值仍需手工核对）；② tools/audit_dual_version.py 第 4/5 项（Material 常量 / @EventHandler 事件类型）也只扫 .java —— 核心层新增 Kotlin 代码引用 org.bukkit 类型时需自行确认 1.8.8 存在（审计第 1/2/3 项走字节码，对 Kotlin 同样生效）；③ 包层回调跑在 Netty 线程上，新增检测触碰 Bukkit API 必须先 runOnMainThread",
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/compat/**"
      ],
      "feature": "跨版本适配层（聊天 / 标题 / 音效 / 材质）",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.contract.ConfigContractTest"
      ],
      "notes": "聊天走 BungeeCord chat API（1.8.8 与 1.21 均内置）；禁止使用 net.kyori.adventure —— 它会被 shade 重定位，运行时把影子 Component 交给 Paper 会 NoSuchMethodError",
      "gate": "block"
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "paths": [
        "pom.xml",
        ".github/workflows/**",
        "tools/**"
      ],
      "feature": "构建与 CI 基础设施",
      "tests": [],
      "gate": "warn"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs",
      "paths": [
        "**/*.md",
        "docs/**"
      ],
      "feature": "文档",
      "tests": [],
      "gate": "skip"
    },
    {
      "id": "database",
      "paths": [
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/core/db/",
        "src/main/java/com/anticheat/managers/DatabaseManager.java",
        "src/main/resources/config.yml"
      ],
      "feature": "数据持久化（H2 默认 / PostgreSQL 可选）：档案、IP、封禁、违规、规则、统计",
      "tests": [
        "com.anticheat.core.db.DatabaseLayerTest",
        "com.anticheat.core.db.DatabaseLogicTest"
      ],
      "notes": "改 SQL / schema 前必须知道四件事：① 两个后端共用同一套 SQL（可移植子集约定见 core/db/Sql.kt 类注释）；② DatabaseLayerTest 跑在内存 H2 上，任何 DDL/查询改动都会在那里被立刻验证，不要只改 PostgreSQL 侧；③ 迁移一旦执行过就不能再改（schema_version 的校验和会告警），要改用新版本号；④ 新增表/列后 E2E 会断言「数据库结构已就绪」与「数据库已就绪（h2:」两条日志。",
      "gate": "block"
    }
  ]
}
